WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.071
We will start by asking why a workload might need
distributed processing Then

00:00:06.097 --> 00:00:12.284
we will introduce the Spark execution model After
that we will connect SQL and DataFrames

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:18.663
discuss lakehouse and Delta concepts and practice
familiar SQL patterns The

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:24.295
last part of the module focuses on query plans
partitions shuffles and project-style reasoning
